      "updated": 1788788214903,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Authority 2: the attestation quorum, 2-of-3\nNo delivery-team seat sits in it\nThe signature binds recipient, asset, category, amount,\nthe distribution sequence, the pool address, the network passphrase",
      "originalText": "Authority 2: the attestation quorum, 2-of-3\nNo delivery-team seat sits in it\nThe signature binds recipient, asset, category, amount,\nthe distribution sequence, the pool address, the network passphrase",
